# Laravel API Integration

Use the shared Axios instance from `@/shared/services/axios` only.

## Auth header

Token stored in cookie `auth_token`. Interceptor attaches `Authorization: Bearer {token}`.

## Response shapes

```ts
// Single resource
{ data: T, message?: string }

// Paginated list
{ data: T[], links: [...], meta: { current_page, last_page, links, total, ... } }

// Validation error (422)
{ message: string, errors: { email: ['Already taken.'] } }
```

## Query hooks pattern

Use `buildQueryParams()` from `@/shared/utils/query-params` for list filters — it omits empty optional params (e.g. no `search=` when search is blank).

```ts
export function useUsersList(page, search, sortBy, sortOrder) {
  return useQuery({
    queryKey: ['users-list', page, search, sortBy, sortOrder],
    queryFn: async () => {
      const params = buildQueryParams({ page, search, sort_by: sortBy, sort_order: sortOrder })
      const response = await api.get<LaravelPaginatedResponse<User>>(`/users?${params}`)
      return response.data
    },
  })
}
```

## Form validation errors

Use `applyValidationErrors(error, setError)` from `@/shared/utils/form-errors` in mutation `onError`.

## Endpoint naming

`VITE_API_URL` ends with `/admin`. Hooks use relative paths:

- Auth: `/login`, `/me`, `/logout`, `/me/password`
- Settings: `/app-settings/{group}`
- CMS: `/pages`, `/page-sections`
- Contact: `/contact-subjects`, `/contact-messages`
- Countries: `/countries` (FormData, `PATCH /countries/{id}/status`)
- Cities: `/cities` (FormData, `PATCH /cities/{id}/status`)
- Onboardings: `/onboardings` (FormData, `PATCH /onboardings/{id}/status`)
- Legacy: `/users`, `/settings`, `/notifications`
